  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Recovery and legalization of ancestral lands of Q`eqchi`s communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Farmers in the community of Se&apos;konon in Alta Verapaz lack clear ownership of their land and face food insecurity. Asociacin de Abogados y Notarios Mayas de Guatemala (AANMG) works with farmers to increase food by developing skills in crop diversification and in obtaining clear land titles. At the IAF we support community-led solutions to expand economic opportunity in Guatemala. AANMG&apos;s activities assist civil society groups to propel their own development and defend their rights. This grant is part of the IAF&apos;s efforts to address the root causes of irregular migration in Central America.</narrative>
  </description>
